description	"Fallen Barbarian

^2Weaponry:
- A noble steed
- A trusty stick
-- ^3Yellow ^7/ Staff Styles
-- Trips on hit

He died a hero, and for his act of bravery he was granted a gift from Zeus; a noble steed

(After you spawn, wait until you land on the horse before trying to move. Once you're on the horse, press Reload to be able to attack from horseback)"